    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Plain (non-UObject) helper that spawns tryll_server.exe as a managed child, draining its stdout to the log until released. Shared by UTryllEditorSubsystem and <ref refid="class_u_tryll_subsystem" kindref="compound">UTryllSubsystem</ref>&apos;s packaged-build path — those differ in when/which port to spawn on, not in how. </para>
